# Motorhead cine v1
# Teaser #455, Classic -> Remaster #1: Atlantika, rendered as `--from 18.6 --to 26.6` (scripts/teaser.sh).
# Titan (10) on pole, Serpent (4) beside it: the teaser's hero cars.
Race Track 4 Cars 10 4 3 1 2 5 6 7 Difficulty medium Laps 3 Catchup on Start go
Output Size 1920 1080 Fps 60 Letterbox 2.39
Audio on Doppler on

# Twin drones 11 m off Titan's left, low (1.8 m), drifting from its front-left quarter towards its side (4 deg/s), the race in
# slow motion (0.45, tape pitch) so the clean stretch after the crest (race 17.5..20.6: two cars alongside, trees, the red
# roofs, the harbour cranes) fills 8 s. Before video 18.6 the lens is too close at the crest jump and behind a brick wall;
# from race ~20.6 the road runs behind a chevron barrier.
# Twins: a shot whose camera is already on air has no cut, so no dissolve. a_r starts at the angle a_c has reached at the
# cut (-120 + 4 x 5.5 = -98), so the dissolve changes only the drawing (both drones track the same car).
# Slow motion changes the race from 16.6 on (the sim step is Speed / fps): move a shot time and re-check the frames.
Camera a_c orbit Target car 0 Radius 11 Height 1.8 Speed 4 Start -120 Lag 0.05 Zoom 1.3 Clear on
Camera a_r orbit Target car 0 Radius 11 Height 1.8 Speed 4 Start -98 Lag 0.05 Zoom 1.3 Clear on

Shot 16.6 a_c Mode classic Speed 0.45 Pitch tape
Shot 22.1 a_r Mode remaster Speed 0.45 Pitch tape Dissolve 1.5
